{"screen_name": "YU1G4", "file": "YU1G4", "name": "ʏᴜɪɢᴀ", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1851636031696834560/nRP0W_I1.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1482991514276216836/1730333140/1500x500", "description": "skeb▶ http://skeb.jp/YU1G4", "total_works": 24, "scraped_works": 24, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T09:56:32.109245+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T09:56:32.109245+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 6000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T09:56:32.109245+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 6000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 6000, "max": 6000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/YU1G4", "name": "YU1G4"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@YU1G4/works/24", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/20c3b110/uploads/origins/44d0b5b7-1abd-4ff7-89f4-93c1a47cb7d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=91fab031d555e6d061f8dd36fa6d1366", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/20c3b110/uploads/origins/44d0b5b7-1abd-4ff7-89f4-93c1a47cb7d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=91fab031d555e6d061f8dd36fa6d1366, https://si.imgix.net/20c3b110/uploads/origins/44d0b5b7-1abd-4ff7-89f4-93c1a47cb7d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da4c0593ea7b4b180646a78fd5251c63 2x, https://si.imgix.net/20c3b110/uploads/origins/44d0b5b7-1abd-4ff7-89f4-93c1a47cb7d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7f099e41e86bf07a024516097c50e395 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Dear YUIGA, My name is Katusha. I was attracted by your beautiful illustration, and I would like to make a request.\nHere are the details of my request.\n\nI would like you to draw a flower of OC, a space siya.\n\nThe image of the character is a bunny, so we would like you to draw her as a rabbit.\nWe are sorry to trouble you with the composition, etc., but we will leave it to you.\n\nWe would appreciate it if you could check the character design from Google Drive at the document URL.\n\nThank you in advance.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1gyolgA0kj3BwzHpRtPuWI9HLBwBKgU8b", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@YU1G4/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2ba1f44b/uploads/origins/61a63823-1fce-4356-9ab2-62572b48c3c8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4824e2f468ad679b6be32c6d30a9882f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2ba1f44b/uploads/origins/61a63823-1fce-4356-9ab2-62572b48c3c8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4824e2f468ad679b6be32c6d30a9882f, https://si.imgix.net/2ba1f44b/uploads/origins/61a63823-1fce-4356-9ab2-62572b48c3c8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=744024e9db00ea8ee5caa3f125230367 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2ba1f44b/uploads/origins/61a63823-1fce-4356-9ab2-62572b48c3c8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10b84efb66a8b4f381ab80a8023a79fd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、Yuigaさん！👋\nはじめまして。お元気でしょうか？😄\n\nSkebでイラストレーターさんを探しているときにYuigaさんを知りました。ぜひイラストをお願いしたいと思い、ご連絡しました！\nとても可愛くてユニークな作風や、キャラクターをとても愛らしく、そしてキラキラと輝くように描かれるところが本当に大好きです。あなたのスタイルはまさに唯一無二です！🥰🥰🥰\n\n描いていただきたいのは、私のふわふわのドラゴンの男の子です！\n彼は元気で、カリスマ性があり、冒険好きでとても幸せな性格です。\n\n具体的なアイデアは特にありませんが、毛色に合った可愛い鈴付きの首輪をつけている姿をお願いできればと思います。それ以外はすべてあなたに決めていただきたいです☺️\n\nYuigaさんはとても才能のある方なので、きっと素晴らしい作品に仕上げてくださると信じています！😆\n\nこのリクエストをご検討いただければ幸いです。どうぞよろしくお願いいたします。\n素敵な一日をお過ごしください！！❤️💜\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/175SL7H91hYIrIsWqU6FdTguZo3Bag6aQ", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@YU1G4/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7c44050b/uploads/origins/dbbab75b-e970-482c-877a-029be57e8699?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36507c79159bb4dc188d2aafa7c09bc7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7c44050b/uploads/origins/dbbab75b-e970-482c-877a-029be57e8699?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36507c79159bb4dc188d2aafa7c09bc7, https://si.imgix.net/7c44050b/uploads/origins/dbbab75b-e970-482c-877a-029be57e8699?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d1576c3a0d5d9af2789ad47a99d7021 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7c44050b/uploads/origins/dbbab75b-e970-482c-877a-029be57e8699?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc72ba03d7e6d77f4f8be0c95c04932f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ゆいがさん、こんにちは！\n早速ですが、近々ゆるめの創作グループを作りたいと思っておりまして、\nそこで使うロゴの文字デザインを是非お願いしたいのです。可能でしょうか、、\n\n■名前\n・Alchemist\n\n■文字のデザインに沿えてほしいもの\n・フラスコ\n・黒猫\n（⇒ゆいがさんの腕を信頼しています、、ので、指示にあまりとらわれず...！自分の下手な指示でゆいがさんのセンスが上手く発揮されないことを恐れているのです。デザイン上無いほうが上手くいきそうでしたらおきがるに無視してくださいませ、、！）\n\nもしお時間ありましたらよろしくです！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1ErMWiRg2U0sjXxlodaaQMLfsbeEM1OAb/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@YU1G4/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2dc40962/uploads/origins/6d10147d-c376-498c-a25a-eee1a2ba50e5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4826091d0eae13cca10d97b73d19e5f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2dc40962/uploads/origins/6d10147d-c376-498c-a25a-eee1a2ba50e5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4826091d0eae13cca10d97b73d19e5f, https://si.imgix.net/2dc40962/uploads/origins/6d10147d-c376-498c-a25a-eee1a2ba50e5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a918124fd8317277aaee071513d6e90f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2dc40962/uploads/origins/6d10147d-c376-498c-a25a-eee1a2ba50e5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a1d2984c887800def22905680bec45c1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I would love to get my Fennec Fox-Shark Hybrid drawn by you!\n\nI'm looking to use it mainly as a profile picture, so bust up would work perfectly for me, preferably in a cute pose with his ski mask on his forehead or off entirely. I do not have a preference when it comes to their torso clothing being on or off.\n\nAnd if its not too much to ask, an aquatic themed background would be amazing!\n\nHis reference is linked below as well:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1k8rr4zViS544Y-WMF-Z85Dm_j2HVyosP?usp=sharing\n\nI apologise if the reference isn't enough or up to standard, this is my first time making a request to get something drawn so I am not entirely sure what to expect! Nonetheless, thank you for taking the time to read!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1k8rr4zViS544Y-WMF-Z85Dm_j2HVyosP?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@YU1G4/works/20", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b74d6e09/uploads/origins/e6c56a68-fe61-4d92-9f5b-84eb95eb0dff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6dca54934bf4243774ddbd424e9e1db", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b74d6e09/uploads/origins/e6c56a68-fe61-4d92-9f5b-84eb95eb0dff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6dca54934bf4243774ddbd424e9e1db, https://si.imgix.net/b74d6e09/uploads/origins/e6c56a68-fe61-4d92-9f5b-84eb95eb0dff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34c36300916715858e8c1a4ab304751c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b74d6e09/uploads/origins/e6c56a68-fe61-4d92-9f5b-84eb95eb0dff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=53c8012c05ce4c082d9570944f321d38 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you!\nI'm attracted by your delicate style, and I'd like to make a request.\nI would like to ask you to draw my child \"Haruka Tokimiya\" together with my friend's characters \"Sturm\" and \"Furia\".\nI will leave the details such as clothing to ʏᴜɪɢᴀ, but I would be happy if you could draw them in a warm atmosphere as if they are all smiling and getting along with each other even in the cold winter with snow flying around!\nI would also like to use your work as a wallpaper for my PC, so may I ask for a resolution of 1920×1080?\nIf you feel that it is inconvenient for you, such as not being worth the price, you may refuse the request.\nBelow we share the materials of the three people on GoogleDrive.\nWe would be happy to accept your request!\nThank you very much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18ulLY2KknV_Oo15XfsBbwb41gpYGVxbk?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@YU1G4/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/50b85d4e/uploads/origins/69c9d3f5-de07-473d-b1d6-33f082cf88a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd152290379e9660489922d9c80ec6ec", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/50b85d4e/uploads/origins/69c9d3f5-de07-473d-b1d6-33f082cf88a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd152290379e9660489922d9c80ec6ec, https://si.imgix.net/50b85d4e/uploads/origins/69c9d3f5-de07-473d-b1d6-33f082cf88a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3020a86560f219f0b5731e6e6e746daa 2x, https://si.imgix.net/50b85d4e/uploads/origins/69c9d3f5-de07-473d-b1d6-33f082cf88a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=869f490fe8231bccc63b8ff3c3d63736 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! You can draw freely, thank you!~\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/15hTW4bWzmH99i9BVrqPDxFC3GsINLCAy/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@YU1G4/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a1c094f0/uploads/origins/1837e185-df42-4006-a6bb-1688d2d81814?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a243dbd3d4464e020f5dae8842b1bec8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a1c094f0/uploads/origins/1837e185-df42-4006-a6bb-1688d2d81814?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a243dbd3d4464e020f5dae8842b1bec8, https://si.imgix.net/a1c094f0/uploads/origins/1837e185-df42-4006-a6bb-1688d2d81814?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=437a8c2d0f38e73210d6602178f9a43a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a1c094f0/uploads/origins/1837e185-df42-4006-a6bb-1688d2d81814?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6eb5e0c64a9f773aa2ee6c6ec0a43f73 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! \n\nI wanted to request a drawing of my character in your style.\nThe pose and action is your decision, but keep in mind he is bashful and lazy.\n\nYou can share the artwork on SNS.\n\nI will attach a reference sheet for my character.\n\nThank you!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/7u7eCZe", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@YU1G4/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b0547f54/uploads/origins/d3992e88-b1dc-4beb-af98-02e49c786e30?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0e69d7b7cd2332b36a54534d82bc24b5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b0547f54/uploads/origins/d3992e88-b1dc-4beb-af98-02e49c786e30?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0e69d7b7cd2332b36a54534d82bc24b5, https://si.imgix.net/b0547f54/uploads/origins/d3992e88-b1dc-4beb-af98-02e49c786e30?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7469eb832995365661bb5f83a220bf74 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b0547f54/uploads/origins/d3992e88-b1dc-4beb-af98-02e49c786e30?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=57d697b731185da42ac632c18fbce687 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, I'm a new member of the board and I'm looking forward to meeting you! Nice to meet you!\nI would like you to draw my Ori-character, Theo-kun!\nHe is a kitsuneko boy (almost a fox).\nI would be happy if you could put on some ornaments.\nRed collar and black 